# Cross-repo doc-gen artifacts (regenerated, not source).
#
# Nothing inside these files says so, and both read as ordinary hand-written
# documentation -- STRUCTURE.md even carries an add-a-provider procedure, which
# makes it the natural place to record a new step. An edit there reaches nobody
# (untracked) and is then erased by the next generation with no event marking
# either, so the author cannot learn it happened.
#
# Authored public equivalents: docs/consumer-contract.md for wire semantics,
# docs/provider-matrix.md for the provider inventory, README.md for the index.
# Internal engineering notes stay in .cortexkit/internal-docs/.
/ARCHITECTURE.md
/STRUCTURE.md
